- [will_said] BINARY CANON CORRECTION: phext canonically supports binary via base64 hoisting BY DESIGN — binary content is opaque and deferred to the rendering program; not a workaround for a text-only library. Consequence: a phextura paper can encode anything, including a compiler and libphext.
